00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:39.270
After Mattis cruelly plotted to take Birk hostage,

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:48.030
Ronja got angry and turned herself over to
 Borka's robbers to settle the score.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.820
"I have no child".

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:56.490
Ronja found herself brimming with sadness due to Mattis' words,

00:01:56.490 --> 00:02:01.250
and has yet to figure out how to deal with her sorrow.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:10.760
Moving Together

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:10.760
Moving Together

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:46.290
She went out for three straight days, looking for Birk in the woods.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.880
But he did not come.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:03:03.520
Had Borka and Undis locked him away, so he
 wouldn't run off to the woods to be with her?

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:13.990
It was hard on her, just waiting and knowing nothing.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:23.710
Four days have passed now!

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:42.230
Come down and eat breakfast, Mattis!

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:44.690
Stop being such a baby!

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:49.320
Everyone is sitting around the table waiting for you!

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:52.490
Are you listening to me?

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:09.900
Have you had enough, you merry clowns?!

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.190
I-I've eaten my fill!

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:13.730
Me too.

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.900
Thanks for the meal!

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.820
T-Thanks!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:18.820
Come on, let's go.

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:19.820
Hey!

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:21.870
Wait!

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.550
You bastards...

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:08.870
He's raring for a good run.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:13.580
Today's robber's work is postponed again.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:20.090
It's too bad, but the boss isn't up to it...

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:29.810
But this is the time of year when the most travelers are passing through the woods!

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:35.610
All that treasure will slip through our fingers...

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:38.230
What a waste...

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:47.370
Oh dear,

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:53.370
are you guys <i>really</i> Mattis' robbers, the strongest in this forest?

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:57.880
You can babble in your sleep once you're in the coffin, gramps.

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:01.720
We'll go nuts at this rate.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:05.090
It's much worse than last winter.

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:17.020
When something happens to the boss, isn't it our duty to properly defend the castle?

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:21.240
Well, yeah...

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.740
But, you know?

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:27.740
Now that he got his devilspawn back, we don't know what will Borka do!

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:30.580
Send extra reinforcements to the guard!

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.620
Klippen and Tjegge, cover the Wolf's Neck!

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:33.190
Yes!

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:35.580
Don't forget your ambush fundamentals!

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.090
Fjosok, Sturkus, Jutis, Labbas,

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:41.340
you guys are on the castle roof!

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.590
Alright!

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:45.050
Tjorm, Pelje, Knotas!

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:48.510
You three collect as many weapons as you can!

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:49.720
Yes, sir!

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:55.770
Birk!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:59.980
Birk!

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.240
Birk!

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:13.200
Birk!

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:59.580
When I was alone, just having the forest around me was enough...

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:05.170
It seems like it's been forever since I felt that way.

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:15.060
But now... I feel like I can't enjoy anything without sharing it with Birk.

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:51.850
Birk!

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:02.860
Birk.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:10.360
I'm moving into the forest now.

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:12.160
Why?

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:17.620
I can't stand living in Borka's Keep any longer.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.500
Why is that?

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:26.630
I can't put up with nagging and verbal abuse forever!

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:29.970
Three days was more than enough.

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:40.560
Yes, you're right!

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:47.110
And suffering through Mattis' silence is even more agonizing

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:49.360
than enduring verbal abuse!

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:54.500
Me too, Birk!

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:58.240
I'm going to leave Mattis' fort too!

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:01.020
I will!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:04.670
Yes, I... I will!

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:08.880
I was born in a cave.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.420
So I'm used to living in a cave.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.640
But what about you?

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:19.180
I can live anywhere at all with you.

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:22.180
Especially in the Bear's Cave!

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:38.160
Hey, be careful not to lose your footing.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.250
Yeah, I got it!

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.960
I won't slip and fall!

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:53.590
Here we are!

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:12.740
When I was a child, I often stayed out here during the summer.

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:25.500
According to that old geezer, a bear uses this cave to hibernate during winter.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:29.750
So I call it the "Bear's Cave".

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:36.760
I'll come to the Bear's Cave late tonight.

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:39.510
That is, if you'll be there.

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:42.510
Sure thing. Where else would I be?

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:46.060
I will be there waiting for you.

