00:13:45.700 --> 00:14:02.510
<i>You'll never get my sweet child</i>

00:13:45.700 --> 00:14:02.510
<i>You'll never get my sweet child</i>

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:43.340
My beloved mother.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:51.140
Maybe we'll see each other again, or maybe not.

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:06.490
But I'm no longer Mattis' child.

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:16.590
So, I have to go.

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:20.380
Forgive me.

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:10.220
I have no choice.

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:13.180
Be well, Joen.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:25.820
Hey, wake up!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:28.870
What?

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:33.290
Ronja?!

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:40.040
Where in the name of all wild harpies

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:44.050
are you going in the middle of the night?

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:54.600
I'm moving into the forest now!

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.310
What?!

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:59.770
Please tell my mother so!

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:03.860
Why don't you tell her yourself?

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:09.820
I can't! If I told her, my mother wouldn't let me go!

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:13.870
And I don't want anyone to stop me!

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:17.830
Ronja! What do you think your father will say?

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:21.250
My father?

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:26.840
Have I got a father?

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:33.060
Please give everyone my love.

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:35.350
Don't forget Skalle-Per.

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:39.650
When you're dancing or singing songs,

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.790
remember me from time to time!

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:47.820
I think this is the end of dancing in Mattis' fort.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:52.070
Nobody can sing, either.

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:11.010
Ronja!

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.350
Don't go!

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:19.690
Tell my mother:

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:24.150
She must not grieve or worry too much about me.

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:30.700
I'll be in the woods if she wants to find me!

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:34.630
And what should we say to Mattis?

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:42.620
Nothing.

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:48.650
How strange...

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:54.320
That I could be both happy and sad at the same time.

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:47.620
Murktrolls dance only on moonlit nights.

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:53.380
They dance while singing the song of spring.

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:57.680
The song of spring?

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:02.930
Okay.

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:11.170
Gramps.

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:12.900
Gramps!

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:16.820
You dance like an earthworm set ablaze.

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:22.280
Fire is good.

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:27.660
That's right, Ronja. Remember that well.

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:07.620
That's right, Ronja. Remember that well.

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:12.920
Where there's a home, there's a fire.

00:22:16.930 --> 00:22:21.430
And where there's a fire, there can also be a home.

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:48.450
I've been waiting a long time.

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:51.040
Now eat up...

00:22:51.040 --> 00:22:54.830
Before you sing the wolf's song.

